empty
Error file:intersection002 (7): Cannot convert left hand to RList.
Error file:intersection002 (8): Cannot convert left hand to RList.
Error file:intersection002 (9): Cannot convert right hand to RList.
Error file:intersection002 (10): Cannot convert left hand to RList.

[OUTPUT]*/
